     <p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 26.3pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一、本次考试试场：</strong></span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.高一越乔楼2-5楼教室都将作为考场。</span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.以下班级除布置本班教室外还需要布置自修教室</span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;"><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 207.4pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班级</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 207.4pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自修教室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 207.4pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">107</span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 207.4pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3208</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.请各班及时关注考试信息，本次考试</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;">需</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-decoration: underline;"><strong>在11月6日早自习结束后（7：30-7：40）</strong></span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>将考场布置完毕，考完后将考场及时复原。</strong></span><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">请使用考场的学生保持考场清洁，座椅位置不变。 </span></p><p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="color: #333333;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二、教室布置要求</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.教室内摆放45套桌椅，按照下图要求</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7-7-8-8-8-7</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">排列，且间距</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">均匀</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。多余的桌子</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不用</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">搬出教室，贵重物品请收好。</span><span style="color: #FF0000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教室桌椅不足45套的班级可以去3106和3108自修教室搬桌椅。</span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0.20in;" class="firstRow"><td style="background: white;border-bottom-style: none;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right-style: none;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 20pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">　</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: